id: grippy-grabbers-third-effect
name: Grippy Grabbers
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: grippy-grabbers
fromEffect: 3
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Grippy Grabbers' third effect, as a Maneuver: as the Grappler, a Grapple Check - won, their Life by your Might, or the Launch out of sequence.
text: >
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you are in a Grapple as the Grappler, you may target your Opponent as an Instant Maneuver. If you do, make a Grapple Check against them. If you win, you may either reduce their Life Points by your Might or use the Launch Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

# The Grapple Check at the one you hold; won, which asked (chat.mjs grippyGrab, settleGrapple).
[on used]
grippyGrab();
